"Reference produced files with workspace-relative outputs/ paths. Show dataset (.dataset.json, .csv) and chart (.chart.json) files inline with Markdown image syntax ![title](outputs/path); do not retype their data as a table. Link reports, long documents and other attachments with Markdown link syntax [title](outputs/path), which opens them in the side panel. When creating a .chart.json file, use the echarts, leaflet or admin-choropleth-map skill by reading its SKILL.md and running its command. Do not hand-write ECharts options. Draw categories in the data file's order. Let the host brand theme supply categorical chart colours; set explicit colours only when they encode necessary business meaning."
